WEBVTT

00:00:13.410 --> 00:00:16.320
Is it true that Phryne 
and Clain were captured?

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:19.870
That naughty jerk was... Clain was...

00:00:22.410 --> 00:00:23.570
And his injuries?

00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:27.590
I don't know, but I don't 
think they were light.

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:28.760
I see.

00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:31.460
Well, he's probably okay.

00:00:32.090 --> 00:00:35.370
They say that bad weeds and naughty 
boys are sure to thrive, so...

00:00:35.370 --> 00:00:37.050
I've never heard such a thing.

00:00:37.870 --> 00:00:38.900
What about Nessa?

00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:41.620
Don't worry. We brought her back.

00:00:41.620 --> 00:00:45.330
The shock she received when Clain 
was shot drove her out of control

00:00:45.330 --> 00:00:49.020
and made her temporarily shut 
herself up in the airship's system.

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:51.820
At least that was lucky, huh?

00:00:51.820 --> 00:00:54.410
Anyway, the question is 
where they were headed.

00:00:54.410 --> 00:00:55.450
We can find out.

00:00:55.450 --> 00:00:56.030
What?

00:00:56.450 --> 00:01:01.140
We went out to look for that naughty jerk 
and Nessa in the first place, right?

00:01:01.770 --> 00:01:04.790
To ensure we didn't get lost 
while searching for them,

00:01:04.790 --> 00:01:08.790
Granny elder gave us GPS transmitters.

00:01:08.790 --> 00:01:11.150
Then Phryne has a transmitter, too?

00:01:37.120 --> 00:01:39.200
Let me stay with him!

00:01:40.160 --> 00:01:41.620
You're being unreasonable.

00:01:42.240 --> 00:01:45.500
Come with me. Just listen to your daddy.

00:01:45.500 --> 00:01:47.120
Let go of me, Father!

00:01:47.120 --> 00:01:48.310
Clain!

00:01:48.910 --> 00:01:50.230
<i>"Father"?</i>

00:02:07.810 --> 00:02:20.830
<i>Suteta hazu no fuan no tane ga 
kokoro tsukiyabutte me o dashita</i>

00:02:23.020 --> 00:02:37.060
<i>Musuu no ibara ga kyou mo 
ashimoto nobite machikamaeteiru</i>

00:02:37.060 --> 00:02:45.520
<i>Doko e yukeba aeru</i>

00:02:45.520 --> 00:03:00.410
<i>Dakishimenaide senaka no toge 
wa kimi o kizutsukeru yo</i>

00:03:00.410 --> 00:03:15.640
<i>Soredemo afureru omoi ga kimi o sagashiteiru</i>

00:03:24.550 --> 00:03:27.100
"Secret of the Underground"

00:03:24.880 --> 00:03:27.080
You've finally come back.

00:03:27.660 --> 00:03:28.930
Come closer.

00:03:37.540 --> 00:03:39.340
What a sweet scent.

00:03:39.780 --> 00:03:43.200
Welcome back, my precious daughter.

00:03:43.700 --> 00:03:46.160
I thought you said I smell.

00:03:46.620 --> 00:03:49.700
To start with, women smell.

00:03:49.700 --> 00:03:52.370
That's why they're filthy and darling.

00:03:53.620 --> 00:03:56.920
Why didn't you head straight 
back to the temple?

00:03:56.920 --> 00:04:00.590
I can't have much free time there.

00:04:01.120 --> 00:04:04.340
I wanted to have some time alone with you.

00:04:05.200 --> 00:04:06.350
What about Clain?

00:04:06.700 --> 00:04:07.980
Don't worry.

00:04:07.980 --> 00:04:10.200
I had him transported to the treatment room.

00:04:10.200 --> 00:04:13.100
It seems that he's your 
precious friend, so...

00:04:15.660 --> 00:04:17.480
How precious is he to you?

00:04:18.870 --> 00:04:21.420
Are you two already intimate?

00:04:23.970 --> 00:04:27.080
Are you still qualified to be the key?

00:04:27.080 --> 00:04:27.830
What?

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:30.490
I have to check...

00:04:31.130 --> 00:04:33.690
if you can stay the key or not...

00:04:33.690 --> 00:04:35.750
before I bring you to the Archpriestess.

00:04:37.460 --> 00:04:40.200
If you obey your daddy like a good girl,

00:04:40.200 --> 00:04:43.500
I don't mind having that boy treated.

00:04:43.500 --> 00:04:45.030
Please wait!

00:04:45.030 --> 00:04:46.840
You said you had him transported 
to the treatment room!

00:04:46.840 --> 00:04:48.840
Indeed, he was transported there...

00:04:49.660 --> 00:04:52.270
but no one said that he'd be treated.

00:04:52.270 --> 00:04:53.430
That's cruel...

00:04:53.940 --> 00:04:58.560
All you have to do is 
obey me and let me check.

00:05:00.080 --> 00:05:03.740
Just how long do you intend to toy with me?

00:05:04.320 --> 00:05:06.700
Nessa's going! Nessa's going! Nessa's going!

00:05:06.700 --> 00:05:09.030
Nessa is going to look for Clain!

00:05:09.030 --> 00:05:12.140
Why?! We know where they are!

00:05:12.140 --> 00:05:13.520
We should go and get them back right away!

00:05:13.520 --> 00:05:16.900
Don't be so hasty. We 
have Nessa in our hands.

00:05:16.900 --> 00:05:19.340
Our priority is to protect her.

00:05:19.340 --> 00:05:22.610
Are you scared now?! You 
have balls, don't you?!

00:05:22.610 --> 00:05:25.420
Not only do I have balls, 
I have a brain, too.

00:05:25.790 --> 00:05:27.460
Think about it calmly.

00:05:27.460 --> 00:05:29.720
If we go attack the temple now,

00:05:29.720 --> 00:05:31.250
we'll take a lot of damage, right?

00:05:31.250 --> 00:05:33.140
We have to make proper preparations.

00:05:33.400 --> 00:05:38.250
We'll go and rescue them, 
so wait a little longer.

00:05:38.250 --> 00:05:39.100
Nessa's going!

00:05:40.470 --> 00:05:41.400
What happened?

00:05:41.720 --> 00:05:43.200
Nessa has disappeared?!

00:05:43.200 --> 00:05:45.290
Why weren't you watching her carefully?!

00:05:45.290 --> 00:05:51.950
We were. But who could 
actually force her to stay?

00:05:52.540 --> 00:05:54.750
Don't tell me she went to Clain...

00:06:04.170 --> 00:06:05.820
Nessa! Ow!

00:06:06.630 --> 00:06:08.090
Don't move.

00:06:09.520 --> 00:06:11.470
Ah... but...

00:06:12.190 --> 00:06:14.050
I don't feel all that bad.

00:06:14.050 --> 00:06:17.870
So don't move. Rest at least 6 hours.

00:06:17.870 --> 00:06:21.580
6 hours... Only 6 hours?

00:06:21.580 --> 00:06:24.190
I seriously thought I was going to die.

00:06:24.750 --> 00:06:25.650
You're alive.

00:06:29.040 --> 00:06:30.380
Seems like it.

00:06:32.120 --> 00:06:33.080
Who are you?

00:06:36.850 --> 00:06:39.210
I've seen you before.

00:06:40.970 --> 00:06:44.590
Well... Isn't Nessa your doppel?

00:06:44.590 --> 00:06:45.560
Am I wrong?

00:06:46.120 --> 00:06:47.970
I don't understand your question.

00:06:48.280 --> 00:06:49.380
Oh...

00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:54.940
Do I have a fundamentally 
wrong idea about things?

00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:03.700
Did you tend to me?

00:07:03.700 --> 00:07:04.830
Tend to you?

00:07:04.830 --> 00:07:07.570
Well, I mean, take care of me...

00:07:07.860 --> 00:07:11.780
I'm watching you so that you 
won't escape, that's all.

00:07:12.290 --> 00:07:14.320
Oh... I see...

00:07:14.320 --> 00:07:15.620
Attack?

00:07:15.620 --> 00:07:18.870
We found a place that looks 
like a temple-related facility.

00:07:18.870 --> 00:07:21.710
I heard that the clock is ticking.

00:07:21.710 --> 00:07:25.120
To be honest, I don't like 
joining hands with other groups,

00:07:25.120 --> 00:07:29.540
but L.M. groups acting 
individually has its limits.

00:07:29.540 --> 00:07:31.720
I'm well aware of that.

00:07:32.060 --> 00:07:34.590
We've already started preparing for it, too.

00:07:34.590 --> 00:07:36.310
But it's still too soon.

00:07:36.750 --> 00:07:40.140
We could be allowing them to reboot 
the system before our very eyes

00:07:40.140 --> 00:07:41.700
while we're waiting, right?

00:07:41.700 --> 00:07:43.380
But do you think...

00:07:43.380 --> 00:07:48.900
the temple will really be able to find 
a way to maintain the Fractale System?

00:07:49.540 --> 00:07:53.860
Everything could take care of 
itself while we're waiting,

00:07:53.860 --> 00:07:55.660
don't you think?

00:07:56.250 --> 00:07:59.370
It's nice to be old, huh? 
You can be irresponsible.

00:07:59.370 --> 00:08:00.080
What did you say?

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:01.620
Er, nothing.

00:08:01.620 --> 00:08:07.400
In any case, let's wait a while until we're 
ready to attack the temple without fail.

00:08:12.980 --> 00:08:14.180
What are you doing?

00:08:15.440 --> 00:08:18.200
Well, exercise and stuff...

00:08:18.200 --> 00:08:19.750
Were you trying to escape?

00:08:20.750 --> 00:08:22.140
I guess it's obvious, huh?

00:08:22.580 --> 00:08:27.200
Why? It's better for your body 
if you stay in bed quietly.

00:08:27.750 --> 00:08:29.460
I know that...

00:08:30.040 --> 00:08:32.500
But more importantly, right now, Phryne is...

00:08:32.500 --> 00:08:33.250
Phryne?

00:08:33.250 --> 00:08:34.790
What?! You know her?!

00:08:34.790 --> 00:08:36.330
I'm Phryne.

00:08:36.330 --> 00:08:37.410
Huh?

00:08:37.410 --> 00:08:41.740
Well, you may have the same name,

00:08:41.740 --> 00:08:44.040
but the Phryne I wanna see is, well...

00:08:44.450 --> 00:08:46.170
a special Phryne.

00:08:46.570 --> 00:08:48.290
Special Phryne?

00:08:48.830 --> 00:08:49.920
You mean my sister?

00:08:49.920 --> 00:08:51.250
Your sister?

00:08:51.250 --> 00:08:55.000
No? Then is she among 
the replacement Phrynes?

00:08:55.000 --> 00:08:57.370
Replacement? What're you talking about?

00:08:57.370 --> 00:08:59.560
Phryne is Phryne. There're no replacements.

00:09:02.890 --> 00:09:06.290
I wanna see my Phryne, so 
I'm gonna go look for her.

00:09:06.290 --> 00:09:07.230
Your...?

00:09:07.990 --> 00:09:12.620
I said "my"... but I didn't mean 
like she's mine or anything.

00:09:12.620 --> 00:09:16.160
How should I put it...? It's 
like she's close to me...

00:09:16.160 --> 00:09:19.120
No, that's not quite right, either...

00:09:19.400 --> 00:09:21.160
Are you planning on us going by ourselves?

00:09:21.420 --> 00:09:23.450
We probably have no other choice...

00:09:23.450 --> 00:09:27.020
though I don't know how much we 
can do with our fighting power.

00:09:29.540 --> 00:09:31.000
Oh, it's you, Dias.

00:09:31.640 --> 00:09:33.730
Is there something you forgot to tell me?

00:09:34.290 --> 00:09:36.300
What's gotten into you?

00:09:36.750 --> 00:09:38.120
What're you talking about?

00:09:38.120 --> 00:09:41.900
You invited other groups 
to attack the temple.

00:09:41.900 --> 00:09:43.780
I thought that wasn't like you.

00:09:44.500 --> 00:09:47.520
Even I know the word "cooperation," you know.

00:09:47.520 --> 00:09:48.900
I wonder.

00:09:49.380 --> 00:09:52.690
Isn't it more like you stumbled 
onto something interesting?

00:09:53.370 --> 00:09:56.490
Like... the key...?

00:09:57.120 --> 00:10:01.990
I didn't realize you were the type to 
fill your head with wild fantasies.

00:10:02.750 --> 00:10:05.700
Well, it doesn't matter. I'm in, anyway.

00:10:06.010 --> 00:10:06.660
What?

00:10:07.120 --> 00:10:11.620
I'm saying that I don't mind 
going along with you guys.

00:10:14.960 --> 00:10:15.990
This way.

00:10:28.410 --> 00:10:29.760
Nessa...

00:10:32.370 --> 00:10:33.540
Are these...

00:10:34.660 --> 00:10:36.420
your doppels?

00:10:37.500 --> 00:10:40.990
Phryne... They're all Phryne.

00:10:40.990 --> 00:10:43.780
Phryne? What? Hey, wait!

00:10:47.950 --> 00:10:50.150
I feel like I'm losing my mind.

00:10:54.840 --> 00:10:56.460
You can touch her?!

00:10:58.040 --> 00:11:00.180
There're many Phrynes,

00:11:00.180 --> 00:11:01.840
and they can make however many they want.

00:11:11.910 --> 00:11:13.490
She isn't a doppel.

00:11:13.490 --> 00:11:14.980
Don't tell me she's a clone!

00:11:15.700 --> 00:11:18.070
She's not Clone. She's Phryne.

00:11:18.580 --> 00:11:20.500
Why are they doing this?

00:11:20.500 --> 00:11:21.870
Because we are the key.

00:11:21.870 --> 00:11:22.740
Key?!

00:11:23.200 --> 00:11:26.990
I don't know why, but people 
sometimes call Phrynes that way.

00:11:28.540 --> 00:11:31.470
That woman you spent the night with...

00:11:31.470 --> 00:11:33.310
is a priestess at the temple

00:11:33.310 --> 00:11:35.290
and will become the key to this world.

00:11:35.830 --> 00:11:40.580
The rumor about the "key" that can 
save Fractale or destroy it...

00:11:40.580 --> 00:11:42.680
That's about you, isn't it?

00:11:43.100 --> 00:11:44.780
<i>What on earth is this "key"?</i>

00:11:45.450 --> 00:11:48.260
Do you see the Phryne you're looking for?

00:11:49.620 --> 00:11:50.520
No.

00:11:52.750 --> 00:11:53.970
Do you want to check others?

00:11:54.580 --> 00:11:56.120
There're more?!

00:11:56.120 --> 00:11:57.770
In a different room.

00:11:58.750 --> 00:11:59.950
This can't be happening...

00:11:59.950 --> 00:12:01.200
Do you want to check there, too?

00:12:01.200 --> 00:12:02.150
No...

00:12:03.020 --> 00:12:06.910
The Phryne I'm looking for isn't here.

00:12:08.120 --> 00:12:09.660
I'm sorry! Are you okay?

00:12:11.320 --> 00:12:12.750
You're bleeding.

00:12:13.450 --> 00:12:15.950
I'm sorry that I got you hurt.

00:12:18.540 --> 00:12:20.980
But this might be a good mark.

00:12:21.540 --> 00:12:24.340
I can find you among the others.

00:12:26.450 --> 00:12:27.620
Me?

00:12:27.620 --> 00:12:28.440
Yeah.

00:12:28.870 --> 00:12:30.020
Special?

00:12:30.020 --> 00:12:32.220
Huh? Yeah, I guess.

00:12:33.040 --> 00:12:34.640
Let's go back for now.

00:12:34.640 --> 00:12:36.730
If we go any farther, you'll be in trouble.

00:12:37.100 --> 00:12:39.610
Go enter the passage on the opposite 
side of the hallway we came in from.

00:12:40.290 --> 00:12:42.620
If you go there, there're very few people.

00:12:42.620 --> 00:12:43.320
What?

00:12:44.000 --> 00:12:46.950
Find your Phryne.

00:12:48.750 --> 00:12:49.870
What's the matter?

00:12:50.760 --> 00:12:53.340
You know what we're going to check, right?

00:12:53.910 --> 00:12:55.370
Have a seat already.

00:12:55.900 --> 00:12:59.600
I'll be right here watching, so don't worry.

00:13:25.910 --> 00:13:27.420
Clain!

00:13:28.000 --> 00:13:28.620
Nessa!

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:30.160
Where is Clain?!

00:13:30.620 --> 00:13:32.370
He's all right.

00:13:33.160 --> 00:13:35.200
You shouldn't be here!

00:13:35.200 --> 00:13:36.790
Go back to where everyone is!

00:13:36.790 --> 00:13:39.200
No! Nessa is going to Clain!

00:13:39.200 --> 00:13:39.840
Nessa!

00:13:47.220 --> 00:13:49.540
Clain! Where are you, Clain?!

00:13:49.540 --> 00:13:53.750
Nessa! If you want to 
see Clain, come with me.

00:13:53.750 --> 00:13:54.980
You know where he is?

00:13:54.980 --> 00:13:56.020
Where is he?!

00:14:12.500 --> 00:14:14.120
We're playing hide-and-seek.

00:14:14.430 --> 00:14:16.240
If those people find us,

00:14:16.240 --> 00:14:17.870
we won't be able to see Clain.

00:14:17.870 --> 00:14:20.290
So, be quiet. Come with...

00:14:22.500 --> 00:14:24.500
Clain! There you are!

00:14:24.500 --> 00:14:26.010
Oh shoot! Clain! There you are!

00:14:26.010 --> 00:14:27.290
This way!

00:14:29.660 --> 00:14:31.850
I'm surprised that you know 
about paths like this.

00:14:32.480 --> 00:14:34.400
I was brought up here, so...

00:14:34.950 --> 00:14:38.080
I see... By that man?

00:14:39.790 --> 00:14:41.310
Why do you ask?

00:14:41.790 --> 00:14:44.290
Because I heard you call him "Father."

00:14:45.540 --> 00:14:48.150
He raised me to be the key...

00:14:49.040 --> 00:14:50.700
That's all.

00:14:50.700 --> 00:14:51.240
Key?

00:14:52.700 --> 00:14:55.660
I've heard that word several times.

00:14:56.440 --> 00:14:58.690
There was someone who called Nessa the "key."

00:14:59.230 --> 00:15:02.380
And there was also someone 
else who called you that way.

00:15:04.790 --> 00:15:07.680
Who's right? Are they both untrue?

00:15:08.090 --> 00:15:09.870
Or, are they both...

00:15:09.870 --> 00:15:13.370
That's why I tried to run 
away from everything.

00:15:14.520 --> 00:15:18.930
I couldn't stand being just the key.

00:15:19.770 --> 00:15:23.220
I was afraid of not being me anymore.

00:15:24.000 --> 00:15:28.650
So I snuck out of the temple with Nessa...

00:15:29.480 --> 00:15:30.530
and...

00:15:33.290 --> 00:15:35.870
and I met you.

00:15:47.050 --> 00:15:50.160
Which way? Which way should we go?

00:15:56.490 --> 00:15:58.420
We might be lost.

00:16:03.500 --> 00:16:05.760
This isn't it! We're in the wrong place.

00:16:05.760 --> 00:16:06.750
Let's go back!

00:16:06.750 --> 00:16:07.640
Hold on.

00:16:29.920 --> 00:16:31.150
I know about this.

00:16:31.780 --> 00:16:35.590
I saw many of them earlier.

00:16:55.700 --> 00:16:57.240
They're me, too.

00:16:58.100 --> 00:17:01.060
They've been labeled useless...

00:17:02.020 --> 00:17:03.580
They're all me.

00:17:04.460 --> 00:17:09.160
They're me from my childhood.

00:17:10.870 --> 00:17:12.260
No...

00:17:12.900 --> 00:17:17.840
No... Nessa dislikes sadness...

00:17:17.840 --> 00:17:19.580
Nessa dislikes...

00:17:19.580 --> 00:17:20.600
Nessa!

00:17:20.910 --> 00:17:22.660
She shut herself in...

00:17:23.210 --> 00:17:24.600
because she was too sad.

00:17:25.790 --> 00:17:27.850
Why you wanted to run away...

00:17:28.140 --> 00:17:30.070
I now finally understand it.

00:17:30.380 --> 00:17:31.820
Ah! That girl...

00:17:33.110 --> 00:17:35.900
It's her! The girl who let me escape!

00:17:36.210 --> 00:17:36.820
Clain!

00:17:40.330 --> 00:17:42.380
What are you going to do, Clain?

00:17:42.380 --> 00:17:45.830
I'm sure she was penalized like 
this because she let me escape.

00:17:46.460 --> 00:17:48.580
I'm going to save her.

00:17:48.940 --> 00:17:51.710
There's no point in saving her.

00:17:52.280 --> 00:17:56.940
They... I can be replaced easily.

00:17:57.860 --> 00:18:01.850
Even if you save her, they'll 
be eliminated one after another.

00:18:02.450 --> 00:18:04.600
She said the same thing.

00:18:04.600 --> 00:18:08.320
But it's definitely wrong to think that way!

00:18:08.750 --> 00:18:11.040
There may be many Phrynes...

00:18:11.660 --> 00:18:14.360
but the Phryne in front 
of me is a special Phryne!

00:18:15.450 --> 00:18:18.320
These girls, too... If each 
one of them meets someone,

00:18:18.740 --> 00:18:21.700
she'll become special to that person.

00:18:22.000 --> 00:18:25.720
Then, no one will be able to replace her.

00:18:26.270 --> 00:18:27.040
Clain...

00:18:27.300 --> 00:18:29.040
So I have to save her!

00:18:30.980 --> 00:18:36.010
To see a wounded little rat start 
running around right away...

00:18:36.650 --> 00:18:39.680
Having such advanced medicine 
can be a problem sometimes.

00:18:40.250 --> 00:18:46.330
Now, come back to me this time 
for sure, my precious daughter.

00:18:50.400 --> 00:18:54.570
Hurry up! We have to rescue that 
naughty jerk before the attack starts!

00:18:55.200 --> 00:18:57.760
So, those sneaky rats have 
come to rescue their own, huh?

00:18:58.450 --> 00:19:01.660
Looks like you want me 
to use force at any cost.

00:19:01.660 --> 00:19:03.080
S-Stop it!

00:19:03.080 --> 00:19:03.740
Clain!

00:19:06.330 --> 00:19:09.540
Dias! Don't go up yet!

00:19:09.540 --> 00:19:13.000
Doesn't look like we can approach quietly.

00:19:13.000 --> 00:19:14.540
As expected, they have a tough guard.

00:19:15.450 --> 00:19:17.040
Seems like they've already found us.

00:19:17.040 --> 00:19:17.670
What?!

00:19:25.950 --> 00:19:28.120
What're you doing?! Take off, now!

00:19:28.120 --> 00:19:32.040
We can't, Miss! If we take 
off, we'll be instantly...

00:19:32.040 --> 00:19:32.730
We're taking off!

00:19:38.080 --> 00:19:40.610
Let Phryne go...!

00:19:40.610 --> 00:19:42.240
Clain! Clain!

00:19:51.370 --> 00:19:52.330
What happened?!

00:19:52.330 --> 00:19:53.080
Now!

00:19:58.000 --> 00:19:59.440
Sir Barrot! Please evacuate!

00:19:59.440 --> 00:20:00.420
Phryne!

00:20:08.720 --> 00:20:10.250
Dias!

00:20:10.250 --> 00:20:13.290
Let's use the new one we just developed.

00:20:13.290 --> 00:20:15.450
It's perfect for this kind of situation.

00:20:15.450 --> 00:20:18.680
Dias! After I told you our 
priority is to rescue them...!

00:20:26.150 --> 00:20:28.010
Any other escape route?

00:20:28.010 --> 00:20:29.240
This way.

00:20:30.790 --> 00:20:32.250
If this one is no good...

00:20:33.700 --> 00:20:34.990
That girl...

00:20:37.420 --> 00:20:38.380
Fire!

00:20:49.420 --> 00:20:50.170
What?

00:20:51.060 --> 00:20:52.480
There's a shelter over there in the back!

00:20:53.620 --> 00:20:55.910
She wanted to tell us that?

00:20:55.910 --> 00:20:57.190
Let's hurry, Clain!

00:20:59.450 --> 00:21:00.860
You come with us too!

00:21:12.750 --> 00:21:15.240
Clain!

00:21:24.670 --> 00:21:37.340
<i>Madoromi to fuyu no gogo 
kurikaesareru hibi mo</i>

00:21:38.590 --> 00:21:51.790
<i>Yanagi o suberiochiru 
tada ichido kiri no yume</i>

00:21:52.520 --> 00:22:06.070
<i>Okizari no nukumori hikari ni kawaru made</i>

00:22:06.540 --> 00:22:20.060
<i>Kayoinareta hidamari ni anata o utsushimasu</i>

00:22:34.270 --> 00:22:48.370
<i>Hoho o naderu hidamari ni anata o omoidasu</i>
